{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic\u00a0 Diablo-style \u00a0random affix system with vast equipment variety. Legendary items that fundamentally alter skill behavior or combat mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/extras/bf1f6e4018a9161936bce7b27acb9e58.avif?t=1773813857\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple skills, each leveling through skill tomes. Unlock extensive skill specializations, choosing different masteries for each skill. Allocate skill points strategically to synergize with your equipment loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/extras/39c2b8aeeed0905e1a201fe21a62ea90.avif?t=1773813857\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Passive Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive passive skill web offering deep strategic build possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/extras/a076c6f363432ef2cd5a4ca7aea4bf0b.avif?t=1773813857\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Map &amp; Procedural Dungeons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fantasy world map and randomly generated dungeons. Each area features unique enemies, bosses, and collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/extras/9b839cde68e3cdecae1d428225c7444a.avif?t=1773813857\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot Filters &amp; Inventory Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful, intuitive drop filters and expansive storage keep you focused on what matters. True idle relaxation without tedious item sorting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/extras/c9f50d250c370756070b807d4041f976.avif?t=1773813857\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Achievements &amp; Codex</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to unlock codex entries and achievements. Gain non-combat progression like movement speed, drop rates, and inventory expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/extras/76ad439233a0a620648ebc4e31f139de.avif?t=1773813857\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941590?t=1773813857","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/8095059ffd4883c7d2371733bb8b1e9b4cd87c27/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773813857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/ec116c6fd47d49eb051a13a844128920324838c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773813857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/ec116c6fd47d49eb051a13a844128920324838c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773813857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic\u00a0 Diablo-style \u00a0random affix system with vast equipment variety. Legendary items that fundamentally alter skill behavior or combat mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/extras/bf1f6e4018a9161936bce7b27acb9e58.avif?t=1773813857\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple skills, each leveling through skill tomes. Unlock extensive skill specializations, choosing different masteries for each skill. Allocate skill points strategically to synergize with your equipment loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/extras/39c2b8aeeed0905e1a201fe21a62ea90.avif?t=1773813857\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Passive Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive passive skill web offering deep strategic build possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/extras/a076c6f363432ef2cd5a4ca7aea4bf0b.avif?t=1773813857\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Map &amp; Procedural Dungeons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fantasy world map and randomly generated dungeons. Each area features unique enemies, bosses, and collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/extras/9b839cde68e3cdecae1d428225c7444a.avif?t=1773813857\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot Filters &amp; Inventory Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful, intuitive drop filters and expansive storage keep you focused on what matters. True idle relaxation without tedious item sorting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/extras/c9f50d250c370756070b807d4041f976.avif?t=1773813857\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Achievements &amp; Codex</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to unlock codex entries and achievements. Gain non-combat progression like movement speed, drop rates, and inventory expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/extras/76ad439233a0a620648ebc4e31f139de.avif?t=1773813857\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>","developers":["JianBing"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/154d48b67bc0b17dd06274eff6c4e42ce77e8513/header.jpg?t=1773813857","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Idle:Dungeon Daily","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Dual-Core 1.6GHz or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphic card with DX10 (Shader-Model 4.0) abilities<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["JianBing"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941590/7bb40137ae56675aab757f5c54c063cbccb571ea/ss_7bb40137ae566